crash = Oops, Trill has encountered an error and has crashed!

    When reporting this crash, please include the following log file:

    {$path}

crash-no-log = Oops, Trill has encountered an error and has crashed!

    {$error}

crash-winlator = Oops, Trill has encountered an error and has crashed!

    Please change Graphics Driver of Winlator Container, then try to run Trill again.

    If the crash persists, please include the following log file when reporting:

    {$path}
